        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Add plain vs range syntax section to container queries guide]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44014</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44014"/>
        <updated>2026-05-06T06:15:53.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105274?u=173310b843e2751843265438af8cfb79eda02039&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Documents the difference between the <code class="notranslate">:</code> (plain) and <code class="notranslate">=</code> (range) forms of <code class="notranslate">style()</code> in container style queries:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Adds a new section to the container size and style queries guide.</li>
<li>Adds a summary in the <code class="notranslate">@container</code> reference linking to the guide.</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">To clear the difference between <code class="notranslate">style(--n: 3)</code> and <code class="notranslate">style(--n = 3)</code>.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Spec: <a href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-conditional-5/#style-container-features" rel="nofollow">CSS Conditional 5 §6.2 Style Container Features</a>.</li>
<li>Inspired by <a href="https://css-tip.com/if-trick/" rel="nofollow">The Hidden Trick of Style Queries and <code class="notranslate">if()</code></a> by Temani Afif.</li>
<li>Related Firefox DevTools work: <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2032963" rel="nofollow">bug 2032963</a>.</li>
</ul>]]></content>
